{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/SignalGroupRef\/onNotify(flags:handler:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"onNotify","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"flags","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"ConnectFlags","preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject12ConnectFlagsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ConnectFlags","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" = ConnectFlags(0), "},{"text":"handler","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ObjectRef","preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject0B3RefV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ObjectRef"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"ParamSpecRef","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ParamSpecRef","preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject12ParamSpecRefV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"flags","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Flags","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"handler","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The signal handler to call","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Run the given callback whenever the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notify"},{"type":"text","text":" signal is emitted"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"